{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51328","headline":"登瀛洲阁〖1〗 · 李愿","name":"登瀛洲阁〖1〗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠阁傍瀛洲，洲中胜事幽。\n沙明眠雪鹭，波涨宿霜鸥。\n溅雨荷盘腻，萦风柳带柔。\n公余自多暇，尊酒奉仙游。\n（曹汛谓康熙《蓬莱县志》卷二、乾隆《登州府志》卷；用均云《登蓬莱阁》爲宋李愿撰。\n并疑其人约欧阳修同时。\n姑仍存之，俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李愿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}